WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:01.293
Jeff:
Do you think we'll make it?

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.295
Not without my team.

00:00:03.462 --> 00:00:04.796
Finch:
We do this together.

00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:06.089
♪♪

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:07.382
(Warning Klaxons blare)

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:11.929
Finch:
It all happened so fast.

00:00:11.929 --> 00:00:14.389
(Warning Klaxons blare)

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:16.058
Finch:
There was a solar flare.

00:00:16.058 --> 00:00:18.310
(Warning Klaxons blare)

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.896
Finch:
Goodbye crops and food, goodbye
everything.

00:00:20.896 --> 00:00:21.897
(Warning Klaxons blare)

00:00:21.897 --> 00:00:22.981
♪♪

00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:24.733
Finch:
So I... hid...

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:26.526
(Deep breath)
(Door shut)

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:28.654
...frightened and so alone.

00:00:28.654 --> 00:00:31.365
♪♪

00:00:31.365 --> 00:00:32.241
Finch:
And I found you.

00:00:32.241 --> 00:00:33.534
♪♪
(Dog whimpering)

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:37.162
♪♪

00:00:37.162 --> 00:00:37.829
Well, what should we have?

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:39.164
(Dog whimpering)

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:40.332
Get your elbows off the table.

00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:42.501
Get your elbows off the table.

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.002
Alright, you're next.

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:44.795
(Dog whimpering)

00:00:44.795 --> 00:00:45.963
♪♪

00:00:45.963 --> 00:00:48.757
Finch:
You see, I'm developing
something interesting.

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:49.341
(Electrical click)

00:00:49.341 --> 00:00:51.260
A giant leap of faith.

00:00:51.677 --> 00:00:53.053
(Electrical click)
(Robot beeping)

00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:54.263
(Sight of joy)

00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:56.098
Now if you can speak,

00:00:56.098 --> 00:00:58.058
tell me something... about you.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:01.103
beep, beep, beep
Robots must protect dog.

00:01:01.103 --> 00:01:02.729
(Laughing)
(Dog whimpering)

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:04.022
(Alarm "warning")

00:01:04.022 --> 00:01:06.441
Finch:
We don't go before that storm
hits, we'll die.

00:01:06.441 --> 00:01:07.025
Finch:
All of us.

00:01:07.818 --> 00:01:09.069
As soon as you can walk, we're
leaving.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:09.695
(Barking)

00:01:09.695 --> 00:01:11.363
Jeff:
One, two, one, two.

00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:13.407
(Dog barking)
One...

00:01:13.407 --> 00:01:14.366
That's falling.

00:01:14.366 --> 00:01:15.575
Jeff:
One, two,
(Dog whimpering)

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:16.493
♪♪

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:18.161
Finch:
Head west, over the mountains.

00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:18.453
♪♪

00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:20.330
Jeff:
Would you like me to drive?

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:20.914
(Barking)

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:21.999
Don't oversteer.

00:01:22.374 --> 00:01:23.417
Finch:
That's oversteering!

00:01:23.417 --> 00:01:23.750
Jeff:
Sorry.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.127
Ease your foot up just a hair.

00:01:26.211 --> 00:01:27.254
Perfect.

00:01:28.005 --> 00:01:29.089
(Horn honking)

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:29.589
Huh.

00:01:30.382 --> 00:01:31.633
(Dog barking)

00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:32.926
Hey, what's all the fuss?

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:34.594
I learned to talk dog.

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:37.431
I don't think it likes me.

00:01:37.431 --> 00:01:38.181
(Barking)

00:01:38.181 --> 00:01:39.308
(Wind sound)

00:01:39.308 --> 00:01:40.183
Come and see this.

00:01:40.183 --> 00:01:40.767
(Barking)

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.060
(Wind sound)

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:44.187
Finch:
Tie the RV down.

00:01:44.187 --> 00:01:48.275
(Wind sound)

00:01:48.275 --> 00:01:49.609
Hang on to something,

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:53.780
(Wind sound)
(Crashing sounds)

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:54.531
Finch:
Ooh!

00:01:54.531 --> 00:01:57.326
♪♪

00:01:57.326 --> 00:02:00.162
Finch:
We should be safe once we get
into the mountains.

00:02:00.162 --> 00:02:01.079
But things will happen.

00:02:01.079 --> 00:02:02.289
♪♪

00:02:02.289 --> 00:02:04.249
Finch:
Like 150 degree heat.

00:02:04.249 --> 00:02:05.792
Finch:
UV radiation.

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:06.793
♪♪

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:07.627
And people...

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:08.754
♪♪

00:02:08.754 --> 00:02:10.213
Finch:
...hiding in the shadows.

00:02:10.213 --> 00:02:11.006
Go now!

00:02:11.006 --> 00:02:11.548
(Barking)

00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:14.426
♪♪

00:02:14.426 --> 00:02:15.677
Jeff:
Do you think we'll make it?

00:02:16.094 --> 00:02:17.387
Finch:
Not without my team.

00:02:18.096 --> 00:02:20.766
Finch:
What we do, we do together.

00:02:20.766 --> 00:02:23.435
♪♪

00:02:23.435 --> 00:02:25.771
Jeff:
I believe in you, Finch.

